{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1157131-to-kill-a-demon","id":1157131,"title":"To Kill a Demon","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-11-08T14:56:38-08:00","id":1157131,"title":"To Kill a Demon","content":"I\u2019m pretty new to VTR and I\u2019m just curious how would you go about killing a demon from the Dessent. Just want to know your thoughts.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/20755-seph038","name":"Seph038","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar20755_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"25"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-08T15:05:43-08:00","id":1157133,"title":"","content":"Turn everyone they know against them. Get their families hooked on vitae. Ghoul their boss. Get their home condemned. Start rumors. Poison their credibility. Run them out of town. Destroy their life.<br /> <br /> Then stand back and watch the angels descend.<br /> <br /> Most of all, do it deniably, through proxies. Find a scapegoat. Don't let them find out who's at the real top of the chain. Because if you give them enough of a motive to throw up their hands and go out in a blaze of revenge, the blaze is gonna be a loud one.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-08T15:33:04-08:00","id":1157139,"title":"","content":"Make a deal with another demon...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><b>Social justice vampire/freelancer | He/Him</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Actual Play:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/852858-vampire-the-requiem-%E2%80%93-bloodlines-ap\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire: The Requiem \u2013 Bloodlines</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Masquiem:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/5268-13-licks-the-curses-of-caine-in-blood-smoke\" target=\"_blank\">Curses of Caine in Requiem 2nd</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Storytellers Vault: </b></span><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=None%20More%20Dark%20Publishing#affiliate_id=321925\" target=\"_blank\">Author Page</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/192-yossarian","name":"Yossarian","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-08T18:28:28-08:00","id":1157163,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Stupid Loserman</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1157131-to-kill-a-demon?p=1157133#post1157133\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Turn everyone they know against them. Get their families hooked on vitae. Ghoul their boss. Get their home condemned. Start rumors. Poison their credibility. Run them out of town. Destroy their life.<br /> <br /> Then stand back and watch the angels descend.<br /> <br /> Most of all, do it deniably, through proxies. Find a scapegoat. Don't let them find out who's at the real top of the chain. Because if you give them enough of a motive to throw up their hands and go out in a blaze of revenge, the blaze is gonna be a loud one.</div> </div> </div> </div>Also, depending on their Embeds and Exploits, they don't even need to attack the vampire directly - Unchained have all those same tools, except they don't need to do the legwork. They can <i>really</i> screw a Kindred up, and if they have an uncompromised Cover, they can do it without any real retaliation.<br /> <br /> Ground rule - Never let the Demon catch you doing it. Or jump them from Obfuscate with Frenzy and hope they don't have the right Embeds/Exploits. Demons are surprisingly squishy without some powers.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-08T20:45:10-08:00","id":1157183,"title":"","content":"Why are you trying to kill the demon and who are they exactly?<br /> <br /> (The answers to these questions often lead to the best course of action.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-08T21:15:15-08:00","id":1157188,"title":"","content":"I\u2019m mostly just curious how different people would go about it. After looking at the Decent some of the exploits are pretty ridiculous and I wanted to see how someone would get around them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/20755-seph038","name":"Seph038","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar20755_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"25"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-08T23:07:38-08:00","id":1157203,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Seph038</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1157131-to-kill-a-demon?p=1157188#post1157188\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I\u2019m mostly just curious how different people would go about it. After looking at the Decent some of the exploits are pretty ridiculous and I wanted to see how someone would get around them.</div> </div> </div> </div>Same answer to how a hunter gets around powers like Dominate and Majesty: avoid being targeted by them. Asymmetrical warfare: never start a fair fight when you can rig it instead.<br /> <br /> (And similarly to how not every vampire is packing Dominate or Majesty, not every demon has a given Exploit. Demons tend to have a handful of extremely useful powers and can't really do a lot special outside of those powers' sometimes finicky contexts without dropping Cover and opening themselves to attracting threats.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-08T23:52:56-08:00","id":1157206,"title":"","content":"The Demon Storyteller Guide warns about interacting with vampires. 'Face to face, an individual vampire is a modest threat to a demon. They are difficult to kill and can use a variety of mind-affecting abilities to ensure their escape, if necessary. Most vampires avoid direct confrontation, however, especially with an unknown factor like a demon. They leverage mortal assets, employ strange magics, and use younger vampires to harry enemies instead.'<br /> <br /> Obviously the mere act of bringing attention to a Demon, especially in a way that your own death would not stop, might be enough to drive them off. Finding some covers, digging out information about their pacts and bringing them to public light, even if it's just in the form of a human interest story from the local news.<br /> <br /> The Ordo Dracul seem to know the most about them, through research by working with them. Seeking out a more knowledgeable vampire would probably go a long way, even if it may cost some favors in the future.<br /> <br /> All that said, it would depend on the Kindred. If you're not a fighter, Unchained like making deals, make a deal. If you really want to kill them, just tear them apart.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 11-09-2017, 03:00 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-09T00:38:48-08:00","id":1157213,"title":"","content":"All what has been said before (use masses of mortals, compromise their covers and so on) are really valid way to deal with them.<br /> I'm wondering if you are asking about something more specific. I mean, Vampire are so versatile and the same problem can be faced with several different way to deal.<br /> Are you more interested in a face to face confrontation? If yes, on which plan? Physical? Mental?<br /> Give us more information to come back to you with more specific answers <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":7079,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7079-marcus","user":"Marcus","date":". 11-09-2017, 03:57 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7079-marcus","name":"Marcus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7079_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1119"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-12T09:49:20-08:00","id":1157954,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Stupid Loserman</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1157131-to-kill-a-demon?p=1157133#post1157133\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Turn everyone they know against them. Get their families hooked on vitae. Ghoul their boss. Get their home condemned. Start rumors. Poison their credibility. Run them out of town. Destroy their life.<br /> <br /> Then stand back and watch the angels descend.<br /> <br /> Most of all, do it deniably, through proxies. Find a scapegoat. Don't let them find out who's at the real top of the chain. Because if you give them enough of a motive to throw up their hands and go out in a blaze of revenge, the blaze is gonna be a loud one.</div> </div> </div> </div>This... A thousand times this. The advantage Kindred have over all other supernaturals.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12561-shawarbaaz","name":"Shawarbaaz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12561_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"467"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}